{"v":4,"catch":"「在家扮工」是一個讓多達4名玩家同時領著薪水來偷懶的最佳地方！","desc":"「在家扮工」是一個可供1至4名玩家遊玩的合作派對遊戲。\n扮演著員工的玩家，面對老闆時拼命「扮工」，背著老闆時盡情「偷懶」。\n適當的分配「偷懶」及「扮工」時刻，是「在家扮工」玩家的職場生存法則！\n隨手拿起工作環境中的物資來跟同事享受偷懶時光！「在家扮工」是一個讓您領著薪水來偷懶的最佳地方！","publisher":"4DMacau","release":"2022-11-17","genres":["動作","派對"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 3.1GB / Switch 3.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8a004dc22575d1a244768d05b67d05511507868735cd674829b50ecdc5f903fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4c7e43a6ffc76d9a89fe3ab5636a5ee333d29ebd2f73765304240b6f62eb963e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d86fd4cc2bbb63c160d095445b596522be117246b5c583dd3aacf20837d2b244.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1c06a9d9b6b6d61793131524dc36a624c2f52100e543370475ba2450424788d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9f4c5237c402f8d58ada2faf00a152e42dfd7b3a885c580e0c4366105f4df3a6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d8c5f59429e4aac671cd2336f2221ef166c80525caab8f78c1b81190bb6affef.jpg"],"titleId":"0100120018f4c000","dlc":[]}